+## Supported currencies
+
+The `--currency` flag accepts the following codes:
+
+- **USD** — US dollar (default)
+- **EUR** — Euro
+- **GBP** — British pound
+- **SGD** — Singapore dollar
+- **JPY** — Japanese yen
+- **INR** — Indian rupee
